  "description": "About the Event: Under the visionary leadership of Honorable Vice Chancellor Prof. Umesh Rai This event is part of the J&K Tech & Innovation Surge 2026 Participants are invited to build tech solutions for Viksit Bharat @ 2047 and Mission Yuva Event Details: An initial shortlisting will be conducted after screening from 20–25 October , following which the final shortlist will be announced on 25 October . Shortlisted candidates will then proceed to the final registration process . Date: 17–18 November 2026 Venue: University of Jammu, Jammu Accomodation & Food will be provided by us at a fee of 300 per participant. Themes: AI for Intelligent Governance, Security & Public Services Climate-Resilient J&K: AI, Drones, IoT & Disaster Intelligence DeepTech, Quantum, Semiconductor & Autonomous Systems Smart Himalayas: Agriculture, Water, Energy & Bioeconomy Digital Heritage, Culture & Inclusive Innovation Eligibility & Registration: Open to UG, PG, PhD students, startups, and corporate teams Team Size: 3–4 members per team Registration Fee: ₹300 per participant upon shortlisting (Accomodation & Food will be provided by us) Rewards & Opportunities: Independent prize pools for each theme Official recognition and certificates Potential incubation or mentorship opportunities based on merit Exclusive event merch & goodies Join the whatsapp group here.",
