    "details": "<div class=\"comp-detail purple-dark_un-border-before un_editor_text_live expanded\">\n<p><strong>About the Event:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Under the visionary leadership of Honorable Vice Chancellor Prof. Umesh Rai</li>\n<li>This event is part of the J&amp;K Tech &amp; Innovation Surge 2026</li>\n<li>Participants are invited to build tech solutions for Viksit Bharat @ 2047 and Mission Yuva</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Details:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>An initial shortlisting will be conducted after screening from <strong>20&ndash;25 October</strong>, following which the <strong>final shortlist will be announced on 25 October</strong>.</li>\n<li>Shortlisted candidates will then proceed to the <strong>final registration process</strong>.</li>\n<li>Date: 17&ndash;18 November 2026</li>\n<li>Venue: University of Jammu, Jammu</li>\n<li>Accomodation &amp; Food will be provided by us at a fee of 300 per participant.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Themes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI for Intelligent Governance, Security &amp; Public Services</li>\n<li>Climate-Resilient J&amp;K: AI, Drones, IoT &amp; Disaster Intelligence</li>\n<li>DeepTech, Quantum, Semiconductor &amp; Autonomous Systems</li>\n<li>Smart Himalayas: Agriculture, Water, Energy &amp; Bioeconomy</li>\n<li>Digital Heritage, Culture &amp; Inclusive Innovation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility &amp; Registration:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to UG, PG, PhD students, startups, and corporate teams</li>\n<li>Team Size: 3&ndash;4 members per team</li>\n<li>Registration Fee: ₹300 per participant upon shortlisting (Accomodation &amp; Food will be provided by us)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rewards &amp; Opportunities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Independent prize pools for each theme</li>\n<li>Official recognition and certificates</li>\n<li>Potential incubation or mentorship opportunities based on merit</li>\n<li>Exclusive event merch &amp; goodies</li>\n<li>Join the whatsapp group <a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/HqVjOOYgEN4HcLNiltFL6x?s=cl&amp;p=a&amp;mlu=4&amp;ilr=4\">here.</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
    "end_date": "2026-11-18T00:00:24+05:30",
